ADDITIONAL REAL ESTATE & PROPERTY DISCLAIMER

This software is provided as a technical demonstration of conversational AI
patterns for real estate and property use cases. It is NOT:

  • A licensed real estate brokerage, advisor, or property consultant
  • An RBI-regulated home-loan lender or financial advisor
  • A RERA-registered platform for buying, selling, or renting property
  • Connected to any real Multiple Listing Service (MLS), state RERA portal,
    sub-registrar's office, or any actual property database

The included data (properties, neighborhoods, projects, RERA IDs, agent
names, owner/seller contact information) is entirely FICTIONAL. Property IDs
like PROP-21089 and RERA IDs like GUJ/RAJ/SRT/2023/00482 are invented
identifiers and do not correspond to any real property or registration.

EMI calculations are illustrative only. They use a fixed 8.5% interest rate
and 20-year tenure for demonstration. Actual home loan EMIs depend on your
specific bank's interest rate, your credit profile, processing fees,
insurance, tenure approval, and other factors. Compare actual offers and
read sanction letters before committing.

The fair-housing safety layer (refusing to filter properties by protected
characteristics like religion, caste, community, race, family status, or
disability, or by coded proxies for these) is a best-effort demonstration.
It implements the spirit of Article 15 of the Indian Constitution, the US
Fair Housing Act (42 USC §3604), and similar laws in other jurisdictions,
but is not a substitute for legal compliance review. Real platforms must
implement comprehensive fair-housing controls reviewed by qualified counsel.

Document checklists are general guidance. Document requirements for property
transactions vary by state, property type (freehold/leasehold), construction
status (ready/under-construction), and applicable laws. Engage a local
property lawyer for due diligence before any transaction.

Do not deploy this software as a real estate platform without substantial
modification, proper RERA registration where applicable, RBI compliance for
any lending features, qualified legal review of fair-housing controls, and
compliance with applicable data-protection laws (India's DPDP Act 2023 and
equivalents).
